<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- NUMANA</book>
  <para style="toc1">EPH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc2">EPH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="toc3">EPH - NUMANA</para>
  <para style="mt1">EPH - NUMANA</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Ire bǝn Bulus, iwaŋ ndi nǝ tanyɛmɛ iye Arik ayi nǝ du lɛ kɛ Kristi Yesɔ,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Igar bǝn abǝ zǝ Arik nǝ Afisa, abaŋ ndi atanyɛmɛ nɛ susun amen nǝ nkɔŋ kǝ Kristi Yesɔ:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Arik Tetɛɛ amɔr bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi be nǝk zhin itazhɔk bǝn isɔŋ kǝ sǝk.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">INƏK TSETSER ANU ADIDIK ARE BƏN YESO</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Igbar asak nǝ tǝ nɛ atu ayi Arik bǝn Tetɛɛ ayou Ŋgɔŋ amɔr Yesɔ Kristi, waŋ ndi ne nǝk ta anu adidik ne kiki iyi gbarshu bǝn tsetser anu adidik akɛ Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Tǝ be she na gɔŋmimi, Arik aneka kuti ahria ta bǝ yi amaa nɛ nyaŋ ta bǝn Kristi, tǝ ta bǝ yi tsetser tǝna yaŋ naki mimin ne ti maa. <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />neme Arik nɛ kam ta anyak te tabǝ yi amunɔ maa nǝ ŋɔk kɛ Yesɔ Kristi, ndi nɛ nai anyak nǝ nyɛr maa bǝn iyik maa. <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Duŋ ta bǝ gbar Arik nǝ ŋgɔŋ kǝ ta zhɔk maa, nɛ atu yi nǝk ta inǝk sha nɛ tu yi Izu maa! <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Nǝ min maa tanǝ lu yik ita zhɔk nǝ shur azhizhi amaa, izuk shur nǝ lalɛ mɔr, ne ankɔŋ ane klik ayou Arik nǝ ta zhɔk maa <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />ndi Yesɔ ne nǝk ta kɔte nii ne mgbemgbeb bǝn izhi lɛ maa. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Arik nɛ na tsar ta kiki iyi yaŋ zhi mɔr ndi nɛ nai anyak, te duŋe shaga ne atu yi Kristi, <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />te abɛ nai ndi mkpaŋa te shaga ne blama, te bɛ gli kiki bɔbɔk yi gbarshu bǝn yi gɔŋmimi te tsǝge biŋ amkpa zhin ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ner zhin, ayi Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Nǝ miŋ kɛ Almasihu nena hria ta, ndi nɛ mene zhi tɛ nai anyak nǝ na maa. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Duŋ taba, fe, ndi ta ye abǝ kuti shur asusun bǝn Kristi, gbar ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik! <verse eid="EPH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Bǝn izhineba minyi nǝ yi aner abe Arik ndi izhin nǝ wɔ nkan lɛ yi zub, ilɛ didik kǝ men kǝŋ ndi igli itazhɔk. Izhin nǝ tanyɛmɛ bǝn Kristi, fe Arik nɛ sak zhiŋ ngir ikǝ yi akiki nɛ atu amin ndi nɛ nǝk zhin Izhu Tsetser nǝ kpa nyak maa. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />waŋ ndi ne ta nyɛ tama te Arik atei nǝk ta igadu mɔr keŋ ndi nɛ kpa kɛ anyak sɛ nǝ mkpaŋ keŋ ndi Arik atei ta abɛ hria amaa ashur nǝ gbar asak ayi ŋgɔŋ maa.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nyer bǝn ben Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Ndi kime yeme, mnǝ mbaŋ mkpaŋ ndi mnǝ wɔ kli mgbamgbaŋ min nǝ tanyɛmɛ nǝ min kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ bǝn inyɛr min bɔbɔk bǝn abɛ zǝ Arik, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />Nga bam ne nduŋ nyɛr Arik ne atu min ba, m shur zhin ne ben Arik muŋ <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />bǝn iben Arik ayou Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi, Itetɛɛ ŋgɔŋ, abɛ nǝk zhin Izhu tsetser, iwaŋ ndi atei duŋ zhin bǝ yi mgbemgbeb bǝn duŋ zhin izhi Arik, tǝ zhin bǝ zhiu. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nga mrib tǝ asusun amin abɛ bu tɛ yik ilaŋ maa, tǝ izhin bǝ zhi ka aye nii izhɔk asusun yiŋ ndi nɛ zhɔzhin, adudun ki amaa ayi vuŋ anu adidik ndi nɛ kpai anyak aneshir amaa, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />ben na ta kiki ngɔngɔŋ iyi na Arik iduŋ ta vuŋ anu te tabǝ tanyɛmɛ. Mgbyamgbyaŋ yuŋɔ iyi ndi ne kam kɛ lɛ ne ndum maa kɛ klik, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />iyiŋɛ amɛ ne na ki ne atu ayi Kristi ndi ne lɛgu ne ku te duŋu sɔŋ ne ŋɔk li maa ne gbarshu, <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />gbagbaŋ amɔ Kristi agli nǝ gbarshu bɔbɔk abǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ, iklik, bǝn aŋgɔŋgɔŋ; te naŋ kɔte sak ta kǝ ndi atei su kɛ, bane kab kǝŋe ankyak ba, bǝn kab kǝ nyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Fena Arik ne sagu kiki bɔbɔk ne angus akǝ Kristi tɛ na nǝgu abǝ zǝ Arik abɛ yi Ŋgɔŋ nǝ kɔte nii nɛtu kiki bɔbɔ. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Akabaŋkɔŋ ai kpa maa, ne shaga maa waŋ ndi awɔ kɔte nii bɔbɔk kɔte me.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Yesɔ NE DUŊ TA YI ATSITSIR</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Atei izhineba ba ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, izhin yi ndi abɛ ku nǝ la lɛ nǝ zumimiŋ min, <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ izhin nǝ zǝ kiki mimin yi gɔŋmimi; izhin nǝ zǝ lɛ kǝ angɔŋgɔŋ abǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ izhu yi sha, izhu iyiŋ ndi azǝzaŋa izǝn na ndum bǝn aneshir abǝ yaŋ zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Bai ki tun ba bɔbɔk mɔrɔ tanǝ bǝn yi ndi imǝnɛ tǝna tsǝn nǝ kpa kǝ tǝ bubu yi gɔŋmimi, tǝ na kiki yiŋ ndi ikpa mɔr bǝn asusun amɔr anyerǝ. Nǝ ir kpa mɔr kǝŋe fe taba, ndi kɔtǝ ŋɔwa ayimɛ, ta nǝ men zhi tǝ ta tei yik iya nǝ mfu kɛ Arik. <verse eid="EPH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ama ilɔ susun yɛ Arik iyi tǝtǝk, bǝn inyɛr maa nɛtu amɔr iyi ŋgɔŋ, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ndi tanǝ ku nǝ min kǝ izhu nǝ lalɛ zǝ lɛ maa kǝŋ ndi nɛ glii ta vli nǝ min kǝ Kristi. Tǝ ai tazhɔk yɛ Arik iyi nǝ duŋ ta yik ta zhɔk. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Nǝ yimɛ mɔr bǝn Kristi Yesɔ nɛ lu bǝnebɔu tǝ zeu sɔŋ nǝ kpǝmkpa yi gbarshu yi gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Nɛ na amɛ tǝ abe tsar bɔbɔk mkpaŋ kǝ nyɛ tǝ ina ŋgɔŋ iyi tazhɔk maa yi nyɛr ndi nɛ tsar ta nǝ min kǝ Kristi Yesɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Tǝ ayi tazhɔk yɛ Arik iyi duŋ ta nǝ yik itazhɔk nǝ tanyɛmɛ. Nǝ tanyɛmɛ bai na min ba, ai nǝk Arik, <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />bai ndum keŋ ndi tanǝ na ba, ndi nuŋ abǝ ŋur asa nǝ tumɔ. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Tǝ ta yi kiki iyi na ndum ye Arik, nena ta ne min kɛ Kristi Yesɔ te tabǝ na ndum didik, keŋ ndi Arik ne naa ta aŋyak tɛka nai.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tayi ki zhiin nǝ Yesɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Izhineba abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝYahudawa ba nǝ ŋli, zhɔ &lt;&lt;abǝ yaŋ kɔkzhik&gt;&gt; nǝ zhɔ Yahudawa, abaŋ ndi azhɔ akpa men tǝ abǝ kɔk zǝk (iyiŋ ndi idi nǝ ki ndi alulum anaa akpa men), shuzhi ir kǝŋ ndi izhin nǝ bǝn yimɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Nǝ mkpaŋ yuŋɔ izhin nǝ bǝn yi shan bǝn Kristi. Izhin nǝ yi acɛn tǝna yi aner abǝ yaŋ hria Arik. Bazhin yi nǝ kinuŋ nǝ min kǝ kpa nyak ba, iyiŋ ndi ai kpa nyak yɛ Arik nɛtu aneshir amaa, fe izhin yi nǝ gɔŋmimi kǝŋe kǝ yaŋ zhɔk susun bǝn iyaŋ zhi Arik. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Fe azǝzaŋa ne zǝ Kristi Yesɔ iwaŋ ndi zhin ne bǝn yi shaan bene bɔu Arik ne gli zhin abɛ lalɛ anyɛ gbahir nǝ hrie azhizhi ayɔu Kristi me.<verse eid="EPH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Tǝ Yesɔ ne tu maa nɛ glii ta isɔŋ kǝ sǝk ndi nɛ duŋ Yahudawa bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli Yahudawa ba iya mǝne abɛ yi zhin, mpaŋ ndi ne gab ba ntǝk yaa ma iku kɛ Yesɔ tena lu maa ne bɛ ne zǝr kɛ, mkpaŋ kɛ kyak akpa ayi, <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />ne ku kɛ Yesɔ ne tuŋ ta biŋ ta baŋ ndi tane bǝn te zɔr nɛ akpa nǝ cɛr bǝn nǝk nkan lɛ yi Yahudawa nǝ bla nǝ kiki iyiŋ ndi abɛ nai tɛna zǝǝ. Nǝ na nyak maa ndi abɛ buu ner yayas ne min kɛ ayaa, tɛ yik sɔŋ kǝ sǝk ne kpa ane Yahudawa bǝn abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Nǝ ku maa nǝ mkpɔk tu kuŋkun kǝ gen Kristi nɛ zir ikyak ayi men; nǝ nkɔŋ kǝ kpɔk tu kuŋkun kǝ gen tɛ biŋ anere ayaa ma nǝ kpa zhiin tɛna gli ba anyak bǝn Arik. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Fe Kristi nɛ nye tɛ du lɛ didik kɛ men bǝn isɔŋ kǝ sǝk bǝn bɔbɔk izhineba ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba, bǝn Yahudawa, abaŋ ndi ayi gbahir bǝne bɔu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Tǝ nɛ atu ayi Kristi tǝ bɔbɔk mɔrɔ, Yahudawa bǝn abaŋ ndi bai ŋli Yahudawa ba, ta yi nǝ nye nǝ Izhu tsetser zhiin nǝ ti kǝ Tetɛɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Nǝ yeme, izhineba ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba zhin yi acɛn bǝn agɛn ba; azǝzaŋa fe izhin yi nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ bǝn aner abe Arik bǝn amunya nǝ min kǝ zǝ Arik. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />izhineba, iminyi, ne mɛ zhin netu tanda iyi shur abɛ na ndum maa bǝn abɛ bla tɔ ti, itanda ma iyi Kristi Yesɔ nǝ tu maa. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ayi wa iwaŋ ndi agli imɛ me tɛ duŋǝ flu nɛ akabaŋkɔŋ anǝ nǝk Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Fena ne min kɛ Yesɔ ijineba minyi ne mezhin abiŋ te zhin bǝ yi amkpa ne sɔŋ awaŋ ndi Arik asɔŋ Izhu tsetser maa nǝ miŋ mɔr.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Bulus ne bla abaŋ ndi bai ŋli kɛ Yahudawa ba ilɛ kɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Nga, Bulus, mne kur ne jaru ne atu ayi bla abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba Izhu maa. lɛ kɛ Yesɔ Kristi<verse eid="EPH 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Iyemɛ izhin nǝ wɔ tǝ Arik nǝ ta zhɔk maa nɛ nǝm ndum kǝŋe tǝm nakǝ nǝ didik min. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />waŋa ayi ki suyir ndi Arik ne blam aneyi ne rimla, ndi me neka kuti cɛr zhin neyi watsɔb. <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />Ne tɔ cɛr yiŋɛ, amɛ, izhin te zhi inǝk tu muŋ ne lɛ kɛ Kristi ndi ne sukǝ yir. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Nǝ mkpaŋ kǝ kukub bane bla iki yi suyir iyiŋɛ ba, fe Arik nɛ glii arumɔ azǝzaŋa nǝ Izhu tsetser bǝn abǝ nau ndum bǝn abǝ bla tɔ ti. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ilɛ kɛ suyire ikɛ yi lɛ didik tǝ abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba ayi nǝ kenǝ Yahudawa nǝ ta anu adidik akɛ Arik; ayi nǝ min kpa zhiin tena gab nǝ kpa nyak yɛ Arik nǝ min kɛ Kristi Yesɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Mne yi gɛn ne bla lɛ didik kǝŋe nǝ nǝk ki didik iyɛ Arik, iyiŋ ndi nɛ nǝm nǝ na ndum kǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ maa. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />M yi mbusher nǝ min kǝ bɔbɔk aner abɛ Arik; nǝ yiŋe Arik nɛ nǝm mkpaŋ tǝm du lɛ didik kǝ men bǝn abaŋ ndi ba yi ŋli kǝ Yahudawa ba nǝ yaŋ yik adudun ki ayi Kristi, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />bǝn iduŋ aneshir bɔbɔk abe yik ir kǝŋ ndi ikpa nyak iyɛ Arik yi suyir abǝ na ndum. Arik, iwaŋ ndi nɛ na kiki bɔbɔk, nɛ nyak ki yi suyir maa ire sǝsɛ yi gayir, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />tǝ duŋ nǝ mkpaŋ kǝŋɛ, nǝ nkɔŋ kǝ akabaŋkɔŋ, aŋgɔŋgɔŋ abǝ shar Arik bǝn mgbyamgbyaŋ nǝ gɔŋmimi kǝ gbarshu bǝ zhi mgbyemgbyeb maa iyi bɔbɔk nǝ nkuŋkɔŋ kaaŋkaŋ. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Arik nɛ na yiŋe nǝ kpa nyak ire kukub maa, iyiŋ ndi nǝ shaga nɛtu yi Krist Yesɔ Ŋgɔŋ amɔr. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Ne atu amaa bǝn tanyɛmɛ bǝn abɔu Yesɔ ne bu ta alɛla ane nyɛ bǝn Arik ne ta ta zhɔk ben zhɔk susun mɔr. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Mben zhin, neme, kǝr izhin bǝ kɔr asusun tǝm yik iya ne tu amin ba; tǝ ai yi iyi bɔbɔk iyi dǝk min.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iben Arik ne atu aner abɛ Afisawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Neme Nga mtar agbarum ne ti kɛ Tetɛɛ, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />iwaŋ ndi kɔtǝ ŋli takǝ nǝ gbarshu bǝn gɔŋmimi ata sak kǝ zub men. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />M rib Arik nɛ miŋ kɛ adudun ki ayi ŋgɔŋ maa tǝ be nǝk zhin iklik nǝ Izhu tsetser maa tǝ bǝ yi mgbyamgbyaŋ nǝ miŋ min, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />fena M ben tǝ Kristi atei na kɔb maa nǝ miŋ asusun amɔr nǝ tanyɛmɛ. M ben tǝ izhin bǝ yi nǝ nga bǝn tanda kǝ nyɛr, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />tǝ izhineba, bǝn bɔbɔk aner abe Arik, bǝ yi nǝ mgbyamgbyaŋ kǝ zhi ir kǝŋ ndi ibwu bǝn ilak, ndi itɔm bǝn ikli, ai nyɛr yi Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Iyemɛ, tǝ izhin nyɛ zhi inyɛr maa, kɔ nɛ mɛ ba atei zhii ashaga ba, fena izhin bǝ shaga ngɔŋ nǝ ir kpa kɛ Arik. <verse eid="EPH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Fena ben Arik ndi ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ tsar ŋgɔŋ iyi naŋ rib mɔr kɔ ilɛ yaŋ yik, ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛŋ ndi ina ndum ne miŋ mɔr: <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />ŋgɔŋ kɛ Arik nǝ min kǝ abǝ zǝ Arik bǝn min kǝ Kristi Yesɔ nǝ kɔte mkpaŋ takǝ bɔbɔk, iyaŋ klɛtu nǝ iyaŋ klɛtu! Bǝ yemɛ.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Biŋ atu abɛ zi Kristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Mdi zhin, fena, Ŋga waŋ ndi myi nǝ kur nǝ jaru nǝ lɛ kǝ Ŋgɔŋ: tsǝn nǝ nkɔŋ ndi itsar klik iyiŋ ndi Arik nai anyak ndi nɛ zhɔ zhin. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Izhin bǝ zi tu zhɔk, te yi zǝǝ, tena shur kpa, te vuŋ kpa tena nyɛr akpa. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ne min kɛ nek tu te yi ki zhin te na kiyiŋ ndi izhu tsetser ne sik susun. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Ikpa zhiin, izhu tsetser zhiin ndi ne zhɔ zhin ne zhɔk susun zhiin bǝn waŋ ndi ne zhɔmɔ <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Ŋgɔŋ zhiin ayime, itanyɛmɛ izhiin, bǝn su kpa ne amashir azhiin. <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Arik ayi zhiin, Tetɛɛ bɔbɔk waŋ ndi ayi ne atu yi kɔte anii ne min kɛ ki bɔbɔk ne tu kɔte ni.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kɔtǝ ŋɔ nǝ min mɔrɔ nɛ ta nǝk iki didik anenen nǝ nǝk iyiŋ ndi Kristi nɛ nǝk. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Neme icɛr ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Ndi Yesɔ ne yuŋ shu gbagbaŋ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Te gli abaŋ ndi ne vu ba agɛn ne mgbyamgbyaŋ maa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">Nek ba izhi kiki yi na.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Nǝ bla te ni &lt;&lt;Ne yuŋ&gt;&gt; watɔ ne zi anyak gɔŋmimi. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Iwaŋ ndi ne zǝme, ayi wa ne na yuŋɔ kɔmɔ ne gbarshu te bɛ duŋ kɔte ni bǝ yi anenen. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Ne yi wa nɛ nǝk anuŋ zhi kaaŋkaŋ, anuŋ abǝ na ndum maa, anuŋ abǝ bla tɔ ti, anuŋ abǝ tsǝn gɔŋri nǝ du lɛ maa, anuŋ aye bǝ na dum du lɛ maa bǝn abǝ tsar. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Nɛ na amɛ tǝ abe naa ta bɔbɔk aner abe Arik anyak nǝ ndum kǝ aner abǝ zǝ Kristi, tǝ ta bǝ flu nǝ kpa kǝ Kristi me. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />te ta ba bɛ bin atu bɔbɔk ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn mgbemgbeb kǝ Izu Arik, te na yi mgbamgbaŋ, bǝn zhɔ mɔr te ta bǝ mla aneshir abɛ shaga ne mgbamgbaŋ kɛ Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Neme bata tei na yi ndi amumun ne zǝ Yesɔ ba, abaŋ ndi ŋguŋgu ŋur ba kam ne lǝlɛ, te fuk te kɔmɔ ayaŋ ben amɔ ne tsar lǝlɛ ben ndi ibaŋ asusun amen tena cɔk ba. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Neme, ta bǝ bla zub nǝ min kɛ nyɛr, te ta bǝ flu ne kɔte nii ne miŋ kɛ Kristi ndi wa ayi Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Ayi wa ikpa bɔbɔk, te biŋ te yi kpa zhin, tena ŋur nyaŋ ne min kɛ na ndum kɔte gyaŋ kpa tayi, tǝ na flu ne mtanyeme ne akpa men, ndi kɔte igyaŋ kpa tayi ne nai anyak. Fe ate yi ndi kɔte igyaŋ tayi tǝ na ndum anenen, mkpuŋ kpama iflu tǝ mɛ biŋ nǝ nyɛr.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itsin ndi amumun abɛ Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Nǝ sak kǝ Ŋgɔŋ, fǝna, Me mgbaaŋzhin atɔŋ: kǝr zhin bǝ zǝn tsǝn ndi abǝ yaŋ zhi Arik ba, ndi asusun amǝne akama kɔmɔ nǝ ki sha. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Ba yik ilaŋ abɛm nǝ zhi men ba ne na gli ba agli tibɛ ne vli keŋ ndi Arik a nek kɛ, ne lɛ kɛ yaŋ zhi men bǝn klik asusun men. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Ndi izhi men ne naŋ adɔ bɔbɔk, nɛ nǝk atu men nɛ amkpa nǝ tǝ bubu tɛ azǝn nyaŋ atɔŋ, nǝ zǝn na zumimin.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Neme, izhineba ba ne nyɛ zhi Kristi ne ankɔŋ awaŋa ba. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Ayi lɛ didik izhin ne wɔ lɛ kɛ Yesɔ, ne na tsar zhin lɛ didik ne tu amaa. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Ne bla zhin, ne tu kiki yi na min kukub, duŋ na zhin kiki yi kukub min, yiŋ ndi yi zǝr zhin tǝna lɔm zhin nɛ tu yi bubu; <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />te izhin bǝ kam asusun amin sɛn tǝ duŋɛ ayi ayayas. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />izhin bǝ na sɛn asusun amin te bɛ yi ayayas, te duŋǝ abɛ yi ndi Arik tǝna gli tumaa rumɔ nǝ tsǝn kǝ zub didik ndi yi anenen bǝn tsetser maa. <verse eid="EPH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Ndi amɛ, kɔte ŋɔ ne miŋ min abɛ duŋ timu te abla zub bǝn ikpa maa, te ta yi gab ye akpa. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />&lt;&lt;Nǝ min kǝ mfu duŋ lalɛ ba&gt;&gt;: Kǝr ubǝ duŋ arik akyaŋ aku tǝ zǝn tǝ mfu ba. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Izhin bɛ duŋ bu shetan ankɔŋ ba. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Iner nǝ zhib abɛ duŋ zhib, abɛ lu te vuŋ kpa te na ndum kɛ aŋɔk amaa, tɛ dik anǝk abɛ yi ne iya. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ lɛ mimin ru rɛ anu amin ba, izhin bǝ duŋ lɛ didik kɛ men keŋ ndi tei duŋ neshir aflu, abɛ na lɛ nǝ mkpaŋ didik ndi abɛ wɔ kɛ atai nyɛr. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Kǝr izhin bǝ duŋ laa Izhu Tsetser ayɛ Arik susun ba; tǝ Izhumɔ ai ngir maa kɛ akiki nɛ tu min, ayi nǝk ndi ibere itei nyɛ yi zuk zhin zhɔk. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Izhin bɛ te shaan nǝ lɛk susun bǝn susun ŋaŋar, ben mfu, ben te antam iyiŋ ndi yi kpa tiŋ zumimiŋ. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Izhin bǝ na akpa min ki didik, te na wɔ lɔ susun iye akpa te na zuk akpa min shur ndi Arik ne na zuk zhin ashur ne ankɔŋ ayou Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="nb">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Ndi izhin yi amumun abɛ Arik, izhin bǝ zǝ nkɔŋ kɛ Arik, ndi amumun abɛ tanyɛma amaa <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />izhin bena nyɛr ne akpa min, ir keŋ ndi Kristi ne nyɛr ta tɛ na nǝk tu maa nɛ atu amɔr ndi ayi nklu ne tsik baŋ yi ye mgbɔ didik ne yak Arik ne wu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ndi izhin yi aner abe Arik, ba re tǝ ilɛ nuŋ kǝ bubu tiŋ yi wɔb amba ka alulum ka yi izhib ka yi kǝr abe zhɔ saga nǝ miŋ min ba. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Kǝr bɛ wɔ lɛ mimin nenu amin ba, ben bliblik lɛ kɔ lɔr mimin, iyiŋ ndi ba zǝ ankɔŋɔ ba, ama izhin bɛ yi aner abɛ nyɛr Arik. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ne me: Ba nuŋ ne wɔb amba ben alulum, abɛ yi ne ŋgluk bǝn abɛ te bubu, iwaŋ ndi wa bǝn inǝ zǝkur kpɔk kuŋkun kɛ sub ayi anenen ndi ba yi ne kinuŋ nǝ kɔb kɛ Kristi ben Arik ba. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ inuŋ alɔm zhin ba ne lǝlɛ yi sha, te me mfu kɛ Arik iyi ne atu abaŋ ndi akyak zǝ lɛ maa. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Ne me kǝr zhin bɛ zǝ ndɔ kɛ aneshir abaŋa ba.<verse eid="EPH 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Tǝ izhin nǝ bǝn yi nǝ min kɛ buu, ama azǝzaŋa fe izhin yi ne amkpa ne laŋ ayou Ŋgɔŋ. Izhin bɛ tsǝn ndi amumun abɛ laŋ amkpa, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />tǝ ayi laŋa ndi igli sɛr ki didik yi kɔte ni, itanyɛmɛ, bǝn zub. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Tsi kli tǝ wɔb tsar yi duŋ Ŋgɔŋ awɔ mǝne. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Izhin bɛ tǝ shaan ne kiki yi bu ayi sha, izhin bǝ glii ru abɛm. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Ai ki shisha te bɛ bla iki yiŋ ndi ne kyak zǝ lɛ kɛ Arik anai kuŋkum. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Ama ikiyiŋ ndi aglii aru abɛm ne laŋ amkpa iyi ndende ben iki yiŋ ndi ne zhi yi ba na yi iki suyir ba, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />te ayi laŋ amkpa iyi duŋ ayik kiki ne bem. waŋa ayi ki yiŋ ndi ne di:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Lu kli, iwa ne kurna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">Lu ne ku,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Te Kristi ate laŋ ne atu ami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Bǝ tǝ zǝǝ, kǝr zhin bǝ tsǝn ndi abliblik ba ama izhin bǝ yi mgbemgbeb, <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />tsi kli ne min kɛ zǝ Arik amin te bǝn iyi mimin. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Amɛ, kǝr zhin bǝ yi abliblik ba, fena, izhin bɛ tsǝ kli tǝ wɔb na iki yiŋ ndi Ŋgɔŋ adi abe nai. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Kǝr zhin bɛ sɔ ki rǝrǝ te hwa ba, te duŋ zhin cɔk la. Ndi amɛ, izhin bɛ shaga ne izhu tsetser. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Le zhin nɛ akpa nǝ nkanlɛ yi zabura, sǝsem, bǝn tsetser sǝsem; duk sǝsem nǝ zabura yɛ Ŋgɔŋ tǝ gbar ne asusun amin. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />izhin bɛ nyɛr Arik ne kɔte ni ndi Arik Tetɛɛ Ŋgɔŋ, ne sak kɛ Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Nǝk zhin atu amin izhineba ba alulum ben amba kɔte ŋɔwa abɛ nek nuŋ ŋgɔŋ maa ne sak Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sɔŋ kɛ Alulum ben Amba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Amba, izhin bǝ nek alulum ŋgɔŋ men ir keŋ ndi izhin nǝk Ŋgɔŋ. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Tǝ lulum ayi mgbyamgbyaŋ nǝ tu kǝ wa maa ir kǝŋ ndi Kristi ayi nɛ atu ayi akabankɔŋ; fɛ Kristi wa nǝ tu maa inǝ ta abǝ zǝu zhɔk, ikpa maa. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Neme ir keŋ ndi abǝ zǝ Kristi anegu ŋgɔŋ ma, amɛ iwa bɛ nǝk lumaa ngɔŋ maa nǝ kɔte nii ndi akabankɔŋ anǝk Kristi tu maa.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Alulum, izhin bǝ nyɛr amba min, ir keŋ ndi Kristi anyɛr akabankɔŋ tɛ nǝk tu maa ne kǝ. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Nɛ na amɛ tɛ duŋ abǝ zǝ Arik abe yi tsetser nǝ lɛ, ndi nɛ ŋla ba ne amashir, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />te bɛ na gliu ndi a gli abe akabankɔŋ nǝ tu maa bɔbɔk nǝ re maa, tsetser tǝna yaŋ la lɛ, nǝ yaŋ ngluk, akli kai kinuŋ yi ŋab anu. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Neme, alulum abe nyɛr amba men ndi akpa amen. Iner waŋ ndi ate nyɛr iwa maa anyɛr tu maa. (<verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Mbla zhin, ba nuŋ ndi akyak kpa maa, ama a yɔk kɛ tena kyu kɛ, ir keŋ ndi Kristi anaa abɛ akabankɔŋ, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />te ta yi gab yi kpa maa.) <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Ndi lɛ kɛ Arik idi,&lt;&lt;Neme ilulum atei duŋ tetɛɛ amaa bǝn iyaa maa te las asɔŋ iwa maa, fe iyaa mǝne atei yi kpa zhiin.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />waŋa ayi ki ŋgɔŋ ndi Arik nɛ sui ayir ndi aneshir bane zhi ba ama me lɛ ne atu yi Kristi bǝn abǝ zǝu. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ama nǝna yi ne atu amin: kɔte lulum tawa abe nyɛr iwa maa ndi tu maa, fe kɔte iwa tawa abe nǝk lulumɔ ngɔŋ maa.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Amumun ben Atetɛ.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Amumun, ayi ndum min kǝ zǝ Kristi tǝ izhin bǝ zǝ lɛ kɛ atetɛ min, te waŋa ayi ki didik iyi na. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Ubǝ bǝ nǝk tetɛ mi bǝn iyaa mi ŋgɔŋ&gt;&gt; te waŋa ayi nkan lɛ ndi iyi nǝ kpa nyak yi nyaŋa. <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />&lt;&lt;Tǝ duŋ bɔbɔk abɛ tsǝn anenen amɛ, tǝ izhin bǝ tǝ asɛ tǝtɛk nǝ gɔŋmimi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Atetɛ, kǝr zhin bǝ duŋ amumun amin atǝ mfu ba, ama izhin bǝ gli ba gligli didik, tena tsar ba iki didik yi na, tǝna nǝk ba lɛ didik.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Agɛn ben Atukɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Agɛn, izhin bǝ zǝ lɛ kɛ atukɔ min tǝ nǝk ba ngɔŋ men ne zǝkuu bǝn sisik, ne susun didik, ir keŋ ndi izhin zǝ Kristi. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Kǝr zhin bɛ zǝ ba te bɛ yik te nyɛr ankyak ba, ama ndi agɛn abɛ Kristi, ana ikiyiŋ ndi Arik ne di bɛ nai nɛ asusun amen. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Izhin bɛ na ndum min ndi agen susun zhin nǝ nyɛr, ndi izhin naa Ŋgɔŋ, bai neshir ba. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Shu zhi tǝ Ŋgɔŋ atei nǝk kɔte ŋɔwa idǝk maa, ka ayi gɛn ka ayi sha, nǝ ndum didik kǝŋ ndi ta nǝ na.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Atukɔ, izhin bɛ na agɛn amin iki didik. kǝr zhin bɛ sak ba ya ba, te zhin ne zhi te Arik ane atukɔ ben agɛn ndi ayi nǝ gbarshu, ba tei na zhi ayi ba.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iki tyak ikum ye Arik</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Nǝ klɛtu, izhin bǝ klik ŋgɔŋ ne lɛ kɛ Arik ne mgbamgbaŋ maa. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Izhin bǝ su iki yi tǝ kum yi Arik bɔbɔk, te zhin bǝ tsǝ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ tǝ yar shetan. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Tǝ ikum mɔr ba yi bǝn neshir ne yi ne kpa bǝn azhizhi ba, ama iyi nɛ atu iye izhu mimin, abaŋ ndi agli gɔŋmimi, ne atu ayi waŋ ndi ayi ne mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ kiki yi bu ben mgbyamgbyaŋ kɛ ane rim ben abaŋ ndi abwak ne gbar shu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Ne me, su zhin bɔbɔk kiki iyi tǝ kum yi Arik, te yi ndi iber mimin te nyɛ, izhin tei klɛ mgbamgbaŋ ndi izhin te na kiki bɔbɔk izhin bɛ klɛ mgbamgbaŋ. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Kli zhin mgbamgbaŋ, bǝn zub ndi ririk ne tiŋ ne,bǝn tsǝn anenen ndi adamgbaŋ anǝ ta kab, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />bǝn gar kǝ akpaza mi abe yi ndi ŋub gar bla lɛ didik kǝ men kǝ sɔŋsǝk. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Kɔte mkpaŋ takǝ bɔbɔk tanyɛmɛ bǝ yi ndi baŋ adamgbaŋ anǝ ta kab; tǝ ai yi izhin tei ŋub bɔbɔk ikab iyi ta lu iyi tyak ner mimin ŋɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Izhin bǝ baŋ akatak ndi ane tyak ikum ndi ata aneshir ashur, ben ikab yi izhu tsetser, ndi ayi lɛ kɛ Arik. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Izhin bǝ ben Arik ne Izhu Tsetser didik ne kɔte kpaŋ takɛ, kɔte bɛr tayi, te blaa zhin Arik kiki yiŋ ndi idam zhin bɔbɔk, izhin bɛ sɔŋ shur ayi te ben Arik ne atɔ abɛ zǝu bɔbɔk.<verse eid="EPH 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Izhin bena ben Arik ne tu amuŋ, ndi mte yik mgbemgbeb kɛ du lɛ didik kǝ men, te mbla lɛ kɛ suyir keŋ ndi yi didik. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Ne atu yi du lɛ didik kǝŋe M yi shar, neme M yi nǝ jaru. Ben me zhin Arik tǝm klik susun nǝ du lɛ didik kǝŋe nǝ zhɔk susun.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Itek yi klɛ tu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Tikikus, izumɔr bǝn tanyɛmɛ igɛn nǝ min kǝ na ndum kǝ Ŋgɔŋ, atei bla zhin kɔte nii bɔbɔk ne atu muŋ, te izhin bǝ zhi ir keŋ ndi mǝ yimɛ bǝn ki yiŋ ndi mnai. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Waŋa ai ki yiŋ ndi M sharu bǝnɛ bɛzhin nǝ lɛ kǝŋe, tǝ abe bla zhin ir keŋ ndi bɔbɔk mɔr ta yimɛ tǝ nǝk zhin lɛ didik.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Arik Tetɛɛ bǝn Ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi abɛ nǝk bɔbɔk abǝ zǝu sɔŋ kǝ sǝk bǝn nyɛr bǝn tanyɛmɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Iki didik bɛ yi bɔbɔk benɛ abaŋ ndi ne tanyɛmɛ bǝn ŋgɔŋ Yesɔ Kristi nǝ nyɛr iyi yaŋ klɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>